1.2.0 (2026-10-11)
- updated sourcing on a large number of items (U51, High Seas event, Harbingers crate, Nowhere Vault)
- lux furnishing updates
- new houses and furnishing pack updates
- webinterface for contributors
- new API: GetContainer (folios and book collections)
- old FurC.* calls now return empty results (see API for replacements)

1.1.0 (2026-09-08)
- first bump of the standalone version
- API endpoints now set in stone and with docs
- slash commands for "/lfc"
- moving logic out of the data layer
- several sourcing fixes and updates (rumours, psijic, lux)
- DB schema overhaul
- backwards compatibility

1.0.0 (2026-08-30)
- First standalone release, split out of the FurnitureCatalogue main AddOn
- identical with the bundled lib in FurnitureCatalogue 7.0.0 release
- Multi source support
- Lots of source fixes and cleanup, weekly lux furnishings
